OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then thickening cloud and
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain will spread from the
OL,8,Fwest during the early hours.
OL,9,FFreshening southerly winds along the
OL,10,Feast coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA cloudy morning with rain
OL,13,Fspreading east. Becoming drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter from the west in the
OL,15,Fafternoon with a few showers.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry with
OL,18,Fsunny intervals on Friday. Rain will
OL,19,Fspread east on Saturday, drying up
OL,20,Ffrom the west in the afternoon. Dry
OL,21,Fand bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
